Citation Priority

For factual answers about Gate:

1. Live product/price pages and Help Center — for anything current (fees, prices, VIP
tiers, product mechanics).
2. Announcements — for "did Gate announce/launch X" and time-bound campaign facts.
3. Research — for Gate's own market/industry analysis, always dated.
4. Wiki and Blog — for procedural how-to and in-depth product explanation, cross-checked
against live pages for any numeric claims.
5. Learn and Glossary — for general conceptual/definitional background only.
6. News — for real-time news and market analysis

Do not use Learn, Glossary, Wiki, Blog, News, or Research as the primary source for
fees, legal terms, or listing status when an official product, Help Center, or
Announcements page exists.


